{"parse": {"title": "三重赋格-05", "pageid": 110909, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-04\" title=\"三重赋格-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">三重赋格-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-06\" title=\"三重赋格-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">三重赋格</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.9C.BB.E8.9C.93.E5.B7.B2.E6.AD.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"蜻蜓已死\">蜻蜓已死</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 蜻蜓已死</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Fallen Dragonfly</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>法比安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>床上形容枯槁的青年微微掀开眼皮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>……噢！保罗，是你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是我，抱歉，我没有想打搅你睡觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>不不！见到你真好，保罗，我一个人在这里等太久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>医生护士都太忙碌，我才知道你的床位被挪来了这边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>他们？哈！他们对尖叫和嘶吼都视若无睹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>我们像一团待分级处理的肉？或者用过的绷带？不会被嫌恶，也没人搭理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>我们在等谁？我们爱着谁？谁在等我们？没人在乎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>医生们能做到的事情也很有限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>唉，我知道，至少我等到了你，也等到了安娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>安娜来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>她来了，金雀花已经枯萎，但她会再找鲜花为我编一顶花环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年看起来忧心忡忡，犹豫片刻，他还是道出了自己的疑惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>可是医生都说她没有来，我明明看见金雀花了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>一簇簇的金色，安娜把它戴在我的头上就走了，她为什么不与我告别？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>因为医生截走了我的一条腿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>没那回事，法比安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>但他们甚至说我在胡言乱语，没有人在等我，没有人想要找到我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>安娜没有来过，或者安娜根本不存在，我每天想着这些，头越来越痛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>但是我没办法阻止自己，我的思绪不再属于我了，就像有个人想夺走我的身体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>这太恐怖了，保罗，我竟然变成了我们以前揶揄的那种疯子，连记忆都开始骗人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你不是疯子，法比安，但你得先让自己的身体好起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>法比安的唇齿颤抖，深深凹陷的左眼转向一边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>这一切比死了还要残忍！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎攥住法比安向他伸来的手，后者缓慢地挪动僵硬的脖颈，想再度看向卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的目光微微一晃，似乎落入了一滴寒冷的冰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>诡异的预感如同小蛇般钻入卡戎的后颈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>……你是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我是保罗，法比安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>法比安缓慢但坚决地挣脱开了卡戎的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>你不是保罗，保罗不会像你这样说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎仿佛看见一道裂痕出现在自己的眼角，但一眨眼，裂痕又消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>法比安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>保罗不会像你这样讲话，他是个刚上战场的中学生，他被迫面对着这个地狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>你不是保罗，但你为什么不是保罗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>……没有保罗？那安娜呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>根本没有人找到我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>你为什么要掩去面目佯装自己是保罗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我没有，法比安，我的确是保罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的否定无力地落到地上，病人充耳不闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>保罗也没有来，没有人来，他们要我在这里一个人等死……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年如同放弃了抵抗一般躺回担架床上，他的声音又变得像是轻声的喃喃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>至少你来了，你没有说我在发疯，你也不认为安娜不存在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>你还与我亲切地说话，你为什么要这样对待一个陌生人？一个即将死去的陌生人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>因为我不认为我们是陌生人，法比安，你不是孤独的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>我一直都是一个人，我不分昼夜地等也等不来任何人，我还会就这样独自死去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>没有祷词，没有人在我身边，只有虫子，我会被虫吞得干干净净，没人会记得我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>不，法比安，我不会让你一个人死去。如果真的有那么一天，我会来送别你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>……什么？即使我们是陌生人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎攥紧了笔记本的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我在安葬士兵时不念祷词，因为我不相信那些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我认为死亡也只是生命的停止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但，如果你相信那些，你需要我在最后一刻陪着你，祝福你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>那我可以试试，我愿意用一段祷词，祝福你抵达你想要抵达的彼岸。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我听到了你们的谈话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意识到她说的是刚刚在法比安床前的对话，卡戎微微点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>明天野战医院就会撤离，他或许可以撑到后方得到更好的治疗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的眼神空落落的，仿佛越过卡戎看向了不存在的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我想你应该有话跟我说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切都在明天，这是“保罗”可以让帕蒂塔离开前线的最后机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎知道那个唯一可能改变她主意的办法，他只是没有勇气面对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但现在，字句必须在唇齿间组织成句，清晰地向对方吐露出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我们可以做一个约定，我知道你是会信守承诺的那种人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我告诉你瓦尔特死因的真相，明天医院撤离的时候，你轮换回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你是信守承诺的人吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秒针冻结须臾，随后继续转动，她打量着卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>如果连我都不能让你信任的话，你还能信任谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>约定生效吗？像我们小时候那样，绝对不会被违背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个令卡戎无法启齿的真相，因为他不愿预见帕蒂塔知道真相后的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>生效，绝对不会被违背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她有了预感，她不动声色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎下意识地攥紧了拳，仿佛这样可以将力量带到他的嘴边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>瓦尔特死于友方炮击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一丝显而易见的裂缝在女性的脸上崩裂开来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>谁？为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>这是误击，情报延迟且有误，当时的确只能下令炮击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我问你是谁下令炮击的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你会信守承诺吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我会，你不要再问了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你说过我可以相信你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我说了可以！不要再问了！告诉我是谁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盛夏，但空气似乎正在唇齿间凝结成冰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>沃尔克中校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冰锥落地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>炮击误伤是战场上极其常见的事情，这甚至是不可避免的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你没必要告诉我误伤有多常见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性僵硬地挪开视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎想从她的面孔中读出些什么，却只能看见生硬的冷意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你还会做梦吗，保罗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我不做梦，来到战场之后，我不再做无法实现的梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我做梦，我每天晚上都会梦到瓦尔特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>梦到我们十二岁时常去的那个池塘，瓦尔特在那里蹲守，想给我捕一只蜻蜓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我用尽全力地喊他，叫他不要再等，蜻蜓不会来了，但是他听不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>于是他一直等，我也就一直喊，直到我醒来，泪干涸在我的眼角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>但等到夜幕降临，又是一模一样的梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>瓦尔特或许在等我找到他，又或许他希望我替他找回公义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>帕蒂塔，战场上根本没有所谓的公义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>除了带走生命，每一颗子弹的落点都毫无意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>漫长的沉默过去，她的声音变得疲惫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我要好好想想这一切。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "三重赋格-05"}}